        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "So Manasseh slept with his fathers, and they buried him in his own house: and Amon his son reigned in his stead.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 33:20",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Amon was two and twenty years old when he began to reign, and reigned two years in Jerusalem.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4,
            "text": "2 Kgs. 21:19 (19–24)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 8
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 33:21",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "But he did that which was evil in the sight of the Lord, as did Manasseh his father: for Amon sacrificed unto all the carved images which Manasseh his father had made, and served them;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 25
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 33:22",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And humbled not himself before the Lord, as Manasseh his father had humbled himself; but Amon trespassed more and more.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 33:23",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And his servants conspired against him, and slew him in his own house.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 33:24",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 33,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "But the people of the land slew all them that had conspired against king Amon; and the people of the land made Josiah his son king in his stead.",
